*.key

# Local pi agent state — must never be baked into the image. pi/models.json is
# copied explicitly in the Dockerfile; auth.json (pi credentials) and sessions/
# are local-only, so excluding them keeps a populated local auth file from ever
# leaking into a built image (the Dockerfile's "no secrets baked in" invariant).
pi/auth.json
pi/sessions/

